{"2714930": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Harbor", "steam_appid": 2714930, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal in Harbor is to survive. In the breathtaking atmosphere of post-apocalyptic anarchy, you must gain access to limited resources and protect everything you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face more than just hunger and thirst! You can form alliances, build shelters, and trade with others. In this open world, everything is out to get you. No democracy, no rules—there’s only one safe zone: HARBOR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the items around you to survive and explore the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the resources you gather, you’ll be able to craft tools, weapons, clothing, and other essential items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most critical things in the game are Clean Blood and Fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the Harbor zone to take on missions, trade resources, and ensure your character’s temporary safety within the secure zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>New! A completely revamped, fast and user-friendly building system is coming.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/e483c2159c38266602eb74cd6ffa28c9.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/e483c2159c38266602eb74cd6ffa28c9.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/e483c2159c38266602eb74cd6ffa28c9.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>New! You’ll be able to upgrade your structures to stronger levels; a 3-stage improvement system is coming to building.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/6c77ddfe80a732382ed858beb2c9a8c3.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/6c77ddfe80a732382ed858beb2c9a8c3.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/6c77ddfe80a732382ed858beb2c9a8c3.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>New! All Workbench designs have been renewed and customized. Included in fast and easy setup, they are now much more optimized and practical.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/b9296883dbc9c050d4ce871a63897cee.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/b9296883dbc9c050d4ce871a63897cee.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/b9296883dbc9c050d4ce871a63897cee.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A War Truck and a Train can provide these valuable resources, but don’t forget—you’ll need vehicles to catch them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Secure yourself by building shelters and defending your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death means losing everything you’ve worked for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The only thing left to do is trust no one and just survive. Everything is out to see you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your only goal in Harbor is to survive. In the breathtaking atmosphere of post-apocalyptic anarchy, you must gain access to limited resources and protect everything you have.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will face more than just hunger and thirst! You can form alliances, build shelters, and trade with others. In this open world, everything is out to get you. No democracy, no rules—there’s only one safe zone: HARBOR.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transform the items around you to survive and explore the environment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the resources you gather, you’ll be able to craft tools, weapons, clothing, and other essential items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most critical things in the game are Clean Blood and Fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go to the Harbor zone to take on missions, trade resources, and ensure your character’s temporary safety within the secure zone.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>New! A completely revamped, fast and user-friendly building system is coming.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/e483c2159c38266602eb74cd6ffa28c9.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/e483c2159c38266602eb74cd6ffa28c9.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/e483c2159c38266602eb74cd6ffa28c9.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>New! You’ll be able to upgrade your structures to stronger levels; a 3-stage improvement system is coming to building.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/6c77ddfe80a732382ed858beb2c9a8c3.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/6c77ddfe80a732382ed858beb2c9a8c3.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/6c77ddfe80a732382ed858beb2c9a8c3.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>New! All Workbench designs have been renewed and customized. Included in fast and easy setup, they are now much more optimized and practical.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/b9296883dbc9c050d4ce871a63897cee.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/b9296883dbc9c050d4ce871a63897cee.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/b9296883dbc9c050d4ce871a63897cee.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/d8229e4a554128e6075ddc16f788868b.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A War Truck and a Train can provide these valuable resources, but don’t forget—you’ll need vehicles to catch them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/74ef470222645a129c3bb766305d2cdb.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Secure yourself by building shelters and defending your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Death means losing everything you’ve worked for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.poster.avif?t=1785881672\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.webm?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/extras/a16e9c7c0bfa3d2506e74326036793d7.mp4?t=1785881672\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The only thing left to do is trust no one and just survive. Everything is out to see you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "In Harbor, your sole purpose is to survive. You need to access limited resources and protect everything you have. You will not only face hunger and thirst! You can form alliances with others, build shelters, and trade. There are no rules; the only safe zone is Harbor.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/header.jpg?t=1785881672", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/1d733a6bfb4626baf4844a4702c85aae577d9154/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1785881672", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2714930/1d733a6bfb4626baf4844a4702c85aae577d9154/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1785881672", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10-11 64-bit Operating System<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-4170 or AMD FX-8120<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Compatible GeForce GTX 1080-2070 3GB+ or AMD Equivalent<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 15 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> This game ONLY supports DirectX 12 and will not run on systems without DirectX 12 capability.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<st